        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Avg. Create success flag, Avg. Locate Success Flag, Avg. Resolve Success Flag and Avg. Terminate Success Flag.
</run>
            <run fontcolor='#bfbfbf' fontname='Segoe WPC,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='13'>The expected result is 100% for each operation across 20 processes. You can mention in the chart caption that each termination received two acknowledgements; there’s no need for a separate chart if every process has the same value.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
